WEBVTT

00:13.888 --> 00:15.056
[poignant music playing]

00:15.140 --> 00:19.936
[woman 15] So it means that…
we've wasted another tank of oxygen?

00:21.021 --> 00:23.815
Two gas cars remaining,
but only one canister left.

00:24.566 --> 00:26.860
Which means that we can
never make it to the end.

00:27.652 --> 00:28.862
[breathing shakily]

00:30.238 --> 00:31.823
[canary chirping]

00:34.075 --> 00:35.994
[PA chiming]

00:38.955 --> 00:40.373
[woman 15] We're gonna die.

00:42.208 --> 00:45.670
Yeah? We are all definitely gonna die now.

00:45.754 --> 00:47.088
[Yuna panting]

00:47.839 --> 00:50.300
- I'm sorry.
- Stop being sorry. It's not your fault.

00:52.093 --> 00:54.012
[woman 15] I'm not blaming anyone.

00:54.596 --> 00:56.639
I know this is my own fault.

01:00.518 --> 01:01.853
But why on earth

01:01.936 --> 01:04.773
did I listen to you
and bet my life on your hunch?

01:05.440 --> 01:07.358
You're only the daughter of a liar.

01:07.442 --> 01:10.403
Ugh! I hate myself for that!

01:10.487 --> 01:12.989
Because I knew that
she was the daughter of a cheat!

01:13.073 --> 01:14.824
- [screams]
- Calm down!

01:14.908 --> 01:15.950
Juri!

01:17.160 --> 01:18.703
Please, you have to calm down!

01:19.913 --> 01:21.915
What's the point? Huh?

01:23.166 --> 01:27.170
Why me? Why?
Tell me! Why is it I have to die now?

01:27.253 --> 01:28.963
[sobbing]

01:39.432 --> 01:41.810
Guys. I've got something to say.

01:44.562 --> 01:47.816
The train just passed
through Jinbōchō Station.

01:47.899 --> 01:51.444
And that means we'll soon reach
the point where the trains run parallel.

01:52.028 --> 01:53.488
And that means that,

01:53.571 --> 01:56.199
presuming the other train
is at the same speed, well, then,

01:57.617 --> 01:59.619
they'll line up side by side.

02:01.121 --> 02:03.081
What the hell are you talking about?

02:05.792 --> 02:07.836
I get it. Is that the only option left?

02:07.919 --> 02:10.004
- Hmm.
- [gasps]

02:12.799 --> 02:14.801
- You really want us to jump across?
- [Sohta] What?

02:14.884 --> 02:19.389
The players in that front car were
all dead. Oxygen doesn't matter.

02:19.472 --> 02:22.308
The gas has already been released.
And the doors are open.

02:22.392 --> 02:23.393
But we'll never make it!

02:23.476 --> 02:27.605
We either do nothing and die here,
or we can fight to the end!

02:27.689 --> 02:29.649
Impossible. We'll never make it!

02:31.442 --> 02:33.027
Come with me if you want to live.

02:38.491 --> 02:39.909
[music fades]

02:39.993 --> 02:41.995
[theme music playing]

03:46.017 --> 03:47.101
Count me in.

03:50.396 --> 03:52.523
Mister, are you stupid or what?

03:52.607 --> 03:55.026
Look at yourself.
How the fuck will you make it?

03:55.109 --> 03:56.194
Have you gone crazy?

03:56.277 --> 03:58.279
[dynamic music playing]

04:01.491 --> 04:02.533
Timing is everything.

04:03.534 --> 04:04.953
The train is almost here!

04:07.747 --> 04:09.290
[grunts]

04:10.833 --> 04:13.044
Don't worry. I know you can do it.

04:13.920 --> 04:16.422
You've got this, okay?
Believe in yourself.

04:16.506 --> 04:17.507
[breathing shakily]

04:17.590 --> 04:20.051
I got it… I got it. I can do it.

04:20.134 --> 04:21.427
[gasping]

04:21.511 --> 04:23.388
- I'm with you. You can make it.
- I can do it.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.226
It's here.

04:42.991 --> 04:43.992
Get ready!

04:49.038 --> 04:50.081
Now!

04:58.047 --> 04:59.048
[man 37] Move!

04:59.674 --> 05:01.926
I can do it! Here I go! Here I go!

05:02.010 --> 05:03.761
[screams]

05:03.845 --> 05:05.138
Move your ass!

05:09.642 --> 05:10.810
[both scream]

05:12.395 --> 05:14.647
You died because she's a liar!

05:14.731 --> 05:15.898
[Ryuji] Out of my way!

05:17.525 --> 05:18.568
Jump, Ryuji!

05:18.651 --> 05:19.652
Hurry up!

05:29.662 --> 05:30.913
[Sohta] Grab him, quick!

05:30.997 --> 05:32.415
- [Usagi gasps]
- [Ryuji groans]

05:34.959 --> 05:37.795
[Juri] Help me. Help me, please.

05:37.879 --> 05:39.380
[music fades]

05:45.511 --> 05:46.554
You okay?

05:46.637 --> 05:48.222
[all gasping shakily]

05:58.858 --> 06:00.777
[man 37] There's another train
approaching!

06:08.493 --> 06:09.619
[sounds fade]

06:17.919 --> 06:19.921
[dynamic music playing]

06:50.868 --> 06:51.702
Arisu!

06:51.786 --> 06:52.787
Usagi!

07:02.880 --> 07:03.965
Watch out!

07:04.048 --> 07:06.426
- [Usagi gasps]
- Usagi!

07:07.093 --> 07:08.511
Arisu!

07:09.804 --> 07:10.888
Usagi!

07:12.682 --> 07:14.100
[Arisu shouts]

07:27.780 --> 07:28.906
She was with a guy.

07:28.990 --> 07:30.199
- Hey!
- Oh.

07:30.700 --> 07:32.368
[siren blaring]

07:34.620 --> 07:36.956
[computer] The end of the line
is approaching.

07:37.039 --> 07:38.708
Please stop the train.

07:38.791 --> 07:40.168
[Nobu] We have to stop the train!

07:40.251 --> 07:42.003
Does anyone know how to stop it?

07:42.086 --> 07:43.588
[Tetsu] Why are you looking at me?

07:43.671 --> 07:45.131
- It's the end of the line!
- [gasps]

07:47.341 --> 07:49.260
- We have to do something, quick!
- [Tetsu] No time!

07:49.343 --> 07:50.595
- We can't make it!
- Hang on!

07:52.013 --> 07:53.264
[power surges]

07:53.347 --> 07:54.849
[all yell]

07:54.932 --> 07:56.642
[Rei] That's the accelerator!

07:56.726 --> 07:57.727
[Arisu] Then this one?

08:01.898 --> 08:03.983
[Nobu] It's too late! We're gonna crash!

08:14.577 --> 08:15.995
[silence]

08:31.427 --> 08:33.429
[clattering]

08:39.185 --> 08:41.771
Hey! Look! What about these?

08:43.648 --> 08:45.525
Maybe… you can use them?

08:46.400 --> 08:47.568
[Ryuji sighs]

08:49.487 --> 08:53.449
These are support braces.
Might be useful during a game.

08:53.950 --> 08:55.409
- Thank you, Taro.
- Any time.

08:56.118 --> 08:57.370
[Yuna] Look! We found one!

08:57.453 --> 09:00.373
[Sohta] We found one!
Ryuji, look. We found you one.

09:01.916 --> 09:03.209
[Taro] Awesome.

09:03.292 --> 09:05.628
- [Sohta] Would you like to try it?
- [Ryuji] Sure.

09:06.546 --> 09:07.797
[Sohta] All together.

09:07.880 --> 09:09.215
[Taro and Sohta] One, two…

09:09.298 --> 09:10.925
- [Sohta] Lift. Careful.
- [Ryuji grunts]

09:11.592 --> 09:13.427
[Taro] Okay, there you go.

09:17.890 --> 09:19.475
[dramatic music playing]

09:19.559 --> 09:20.434
[gasping]

09:20.518 --> 09:22.186
[Kazuya] Arisu! Hang in there. Keep going!

09:26.524 --> 09:28.526
[players breathing heavily]

09:36.534 --> 09:37.618
[Nobu] Arisu…

09:38.119 --> 09:40.830
Tetsu, you're the only one
who can save him.

09:40.913 --> 09:41.998
Stitch him up.

09:43.374 --> 09:46.252
What are you talking about?
I've never done that before!

09:46.335 --> 09:47.670
[Shion] You can do it.

09:49.630 --> 09:51.882
You stopped the bleeding and saved my leg.

09:52.383 --> 09:55.261
Look! I can almost walk now.

09:55.344 --> 09:59.223
Sure, I can stop someone from bleeding!
But this isn't the same thing at all!

10:00.766 --> 10:03.728
Okay, this was
all I could find at the store.

10:03.811 --> 10:05.146
- It's a sewing kit.
- [Rei] What?

10:05.229 --> 10:08.524
- You wanna stitch him with that?
- That's it. That's all I could find.

10:08.608 --> 10:10.192
Tetsu, please try!

10:10.985 --> 10:11.902
Please, try.

10:12.570 --> 10:15.615
[Natsu] I also found some water
and alcohol to sterilize it.

10:17.074 --> 10:18.909
Come on! Hurry up! Hurry up!

10:18.993 --> 10:20.286
He's dying!

10:20.369 --> 10:21.329
[Arisu groans softly]

10:21.412 --> 10:24.123
[Nobu] Arisu! Arisu!

10:24.206 --> 10:25.708
[grunts]

10:31.714 --> 10:32.715
- Aah!
- What the hell?

10:32.798 --> 10:34.884
That's to disinfect his wound!

10:34.967 --> 10:37.261
[gasping] It stops the shakes.

10:37.345 --> 10:39.347
[gasps]

10:40.640 --> 10:42.516
[Tetsu sighs]

10:45.686 --> 10:47.480
[suspenseful, emotional music playing]

11:22.223 --> 11:23.349
[grunts]

11:27.019 --> 11:28.479
[gasping]

11:44.120 --> 11:45.287
[music fades]

11:46.288 --> 11:47.957
[gasps]

11:56.507 --> 11:58.968
[breathing heavily]

12:05.266 --> 12:07.143
[Usagi] Why don't you get some sleep?

12:08.936 --> 12:10.479
And what about you?

12:11.689 --> 12:12.732
You were crying.

12:28.998 --> 12:30.207
I can't sleep.

12:32.918 --> 12:34.754
I keep having the same dream.

12:39.175 --> 12:41.385
Something happened that you can't forget?

12:41.469 --> 12:43.846
[quiet, poignant music playing]

12:43.929 --> 12:45.139
I was…

12:47.016 --> 12:49.059
fascinated by death for too long.

12:50.895 --> 12:52.104
And one day…

12:55.608 --> 12:58.152
I crossed a line
I should never have crossed.

12:59.820 --> 13:01.739
And there was no turning back.

13:01.822 --> 13:03.407
[Ryuji] That's everything for today.

13:08.412 --> 13:09.955
[woman] Professor Matsuyama?

13:11.081 --> 13:13.000
I had the chance to read your paper.

13:13.083 --> 13:14.418
I found it very interesting.

13:16.337 --> 13:18.964
So, are you interested
in research about mental illness?

13:19.632 --> 13:20.508
Not really.

13:20.591 --> 13:23.719
I was more interested in the part
about stimulating the temporal lobe,

13:23.803 --> 13:26.514
and how it can reproduce
near-death experiences.

13:29.809 --> 13:31.101
[Ryuji laughs softly]

13:33.854 --> 13:39.068
Well, looks like you are the only person
in the entire university who's interested.

13:39.860 --> 13:42.780
[woman] I read in an article somewhere
that, through near-death experiences,

13:42.863 --> 13:44.698
we might get a glimpse of the afterlife.

13:45.741 --> 13:48.661
[Ryuji] Yano, do you really believe
a land for the dead exists?

13:49.161 --> 13:51.747
I'd need to have
a tangible experience first.

13:51.831 --> 13:53.999
- [chuckles] Tangible?
- Yes.

13:54.083 --> 13:57.586
I hope someday you'll prove that
the land of the dead exists, Professor.

13:59.088 --> 14:01.215
I'm afraid there's
only one way to prove it.

14:01.841 --> 14:02.758
What way is that?

14:04.510 --> 14:07.096
You would have to simulate
a near-death experience.

14:16.897 --> 14:18.482
How about this?

14:20.901 --> 14:23.863
The side effects of that drug
haven't been clinically tested yet.

14:34.832 --> 14:36.375
[typing]

14:38.586 --> 14:39.712
[Yano] Professor?

14:41.088 --> 14:43.215
I've made up my mind. I wanna try it.

14:45.175 --> 14:46.385
Too early.

14:49.471 --> 14:52.808
Don't you wanna discover
a world that nobody else knows?

14:53.309 --> 14:56.478
Yes, of course, but… it's too dangerous.

14:57.813 --> 15:00.858
[Yano] I accept the risk. I wanna visit
the land of the dead no matter what.

15:01.692 --> 15:03.736
Professor, I'm begging you.

15:03.819 --> 15:05.070
Please let me try.

15:06.405 --> 15:08.407
[unsettling music playing]

16:04.254 --> 16:05.297
[music fades]

16:22.314 --> 16:23.732
[alarm bleeps]

16:31.991 --> 16:33.993
[unsettling music playing]

16:44.378 --> 16:45.671
[sighs] Yano?

16:46.213 --> 16:47.798
[breathing shakily]

16:47.881 --> 16:48.882
Yano?

16:49.925 --> 16:50.968
Yano!

16:51.051 --> 16:51.927
Yano, wake up!

17:05.858 --> 17:07.443
[gasping]

17:09.194 --> 17:10.571
[man 1] A medical student has died

17:10.654 --> 17:13.157
while conducting an experiment
at Shushikan University…

17:13.240 --> 17:17.619
- [woman 1] The cause was a drug overdose…
- [man 1] …if it was suicide or foul play.

17:17.703 --> 17:21.373
The professor in charge of the department
was suspected of assisting the suicide

17:21.457 --> 17:23.625
but has not been prosecuted
due to insufficient evidence…

17:23.709 --> 17:27.129
[woman 1] News is now coming in about
a serious road accident near Fuchū…

17:27.212 --> 17:30.924
[man 2] The driver of the car, a man in
his thirties, was discovered unconscious…

17:31.008 --> 17:35.262
- [woman 2] He is in critical condition.
- [man 2] …accident or attempted suicide.

17:35.345 --> 17:38.432
[man 3] There's a rumor on campus
that Professor Matsuyama's car accident

17:38.515 --> 17:41.268
was a suicide attempt
after that incident with his student.

17:41.351 --> 17:43.187
[man 4] I heard his heart
had stopped beating.

17:43.270 --> 17:46.356
[man 3] Well, I guess he finally got to
discover the land of the dead after all.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.776
- [man 4] That's one way of doing it!
- [man 3 chuckles]

17:48.859 --> 17:50.861
[typing]

17:50.944 --> 17:52.946
[melancholy, disturbing music playing]

17:58.202 --> 17:59.870
AFTERLIFE, SHARED CONSCIOUSNESS

17:59.953 --> 18:01.580
NEAR-DEATH EXPERIENCES

18:01.663 --> 18:02.915
NOT BOUND BY TIME

18:02.998 --> 18:05.709
WHEN THE SUBJECT'S HEART STOPS…

18:05.793 --> 18:09.171
…ONCE RESUSCITATED,
THEIR CONSCIOUSNESS RETURNS…

18:11.006 --> 18:12.382
[sighs]

18:39.493 --> 18:40.744
[music fades]

18:40.828 --> 18:43.205
[Ryuji] I learned that
once you cross that line…

18:44.873 --> 18:46.375
there's no way back.

18:48.418 --> 18:50.420
[silence]

18:57.010 --> 18:59.012
[Usagi] There's always a way back.

19:03.475 --> 19:06.019
Since coming back to this place,

19:06.645 --> 19:08.480
I learned something important.

19:12.609 --> 19:14.278
All of our wounds…

19:16.780 --> 19:18.657
become our reasons to live.

19:25.455 --> 19:26.748
You believe that?

19:35.215 --> 19:37.342
Let's go back to our world together.

19:44.600 --> 19:46.602
[gentle music playing]

19:57.946 --> 19:59.364
[Natsu] Arisu?

19:59.448 --> 20:00.824
[somber music playing]

20:00.908 --> 20:02.367
[Nobu] Oh! Arisu!

20:02.451 --> 20:04.036
[gasping]

20:04.828 --> 20:06.872
Thank God you're awake! [sighs]

20:07.581 --> 20:08.874
[Arisu] I'm sorry.

20:11.793 --> 20:14.755
The new game… when does it begin?

20:17.716 --> 20:19.134
At sunset today.

20:23.263 --> 20:25.807
- We're going to be late. [grunts]
- [Shion gasps]

20:25.891 --> 20:28.685
Kid… You're not ready yet.

20:30.896 --> 20:32.064
[grunts]

20:40.656 --> 20:42.157
Go ahead without me.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.285
There's no way we're leaving you here.

20:45.369 --> 20:49.164
It's true.
Arisu, we can't leave you here all alone.

20:49.248 --> 20:53.710
Twice you saved me, Arisu.
The fortunes game, and the zombie game.

20:54.836 --> 20:55.837
And me too.

20:56.338 --> 20:58.340
Well, I suppose

20:58.423 --> 21:00.259
you kinda saved me too.

21:02.344 --> 21:03.470
[sighs]

21:04.429 --> 21:05.597
And me too.

21:06.765 --> 21:09.101
[purposeful music playing]

21:26.868 --> 21:28.370
[sobbing]

21:35.127 --> 21:37.087
[music intensifying]

21:45.012 --> 21:47.014
[thrilling music swells]

21:55.981 --> 21:58.317
[computer] Attention, all players.

21:59.234 --> 22:02.112
The semifinals are about to begin.

22:03.989 --> 22:05.782
Players who survive this game

22:05.866 --> 22:09.077
will be invited
to participate in the final.

22:10.120 --> 22:13.123
Game, Tokyo Bingo Tower.

22:14.541 --> 22:16.543
[players screaming and crying]

22:29.681 --> 22:30.807
[music fades]

22:30.891 --> 22:33.060
[panting and grunting]

22:35.937 --> 22:37.689
[wind gusting]

22:41.026 --> 22:42.778
- Game rules.
- [gasps]

22:42.861 --> 22:45.614
Play bingo on the Tokyo Tower.

22:45.697 --> 22:46.782
[dramatic music playing]

22:46.865 --> 22:49.326
Players must climb the Tokyo Tower

22:49.409 --> 22:53.330
and press the different buzzers
installed at various points on the way.

22:53.413 --> 22:54.873
You must complete a vertical,

22:54.956 --> 22:58.126
a horizontal, or a diagonal line
on your bingo card

22:58.210 --> 23:00.212
in order to clear the game.

23:00.879 --> 23:02.631
- Work together as a team.
- [Sohta grunts]

23:02.714 --> 23:05.092
- And complete your bingo card.
- [Sohta] I got you.

23:05.842 --> 23:07.594
Look at me. Relax, Yuna. Calm down.

23:07.677 --> 23:09.888
- [gasping]
- [Sohta] Make your way up slowly.

23:09.971 --> 23:11.640
- Easy. One step at a time.
- [whimpering]

23:11.723 --> 23:13.558
- [Sohta] Let's go! [grunts]
- [Yuna gasping]

23:14.142 --> 23:16.019
[whimpering]

23:16.853 --> 23:18.939
[wailing]

23:19.022 --> 23:22.359
Players, at the very top of the tower,
you will find a free buzzer

23:22.442 --> 23:25.529
corresponding to the free space
at the center of the bingo card.

23:25.612 --> 23:26.947
Good luck, everyone.

23:30.450 --> 23:31.493
[exhales]

23:33.078 --> 23:34.037
[grunts]

23:35.789 --> 23:36.915
[grunts]

23:43.296 --> 23:45.298
[dramatic music continues]

23:54.641 --> 23:56.810
[computer] Game, Kick the Can.

23:57.436 --> 23:59.646
Can one, start!

24:03.608 --> 24:04.860
[exhales]

24:06.153 --> 24:08.155
- [grunts]
- [players gasping]

24:11.366 --> 24:12.742
- [man 1] Whoa!
- [gasping]

24:15.412 --> 24:17.247
- [man 2] Oh shit!
- Game rules.

24:17.330 --> 24:18.999
Before your time runs out,

24:19.082 --> 24:21.751
return the can
to its original starting spot

24:21.835 --> 24:23.920
and insert the can into its base.

24:24.004 --> 24:26.047
- [glass smashing]
- [man 3] What? Whoa! [grunts]

24:26.798 --> 24:27.716
[man 4] Oh!

24:27.799 --> 24:31.094
- There are a total of ten cans.
- [man 5] Hey, move it!

24:31.178 --> 24:34.014
[Tetsu] So, only ten of us can
make it through the game.

24:34.097 --> 24:35.307
- What?
- [players panting]

24:36.266 --> 24:38.018
Ah… [grunts]

24:39.895 --> 24:40.937
[groans]

24:44.649 --> 24:46.067
[Kazuya] What the hell?

24:47.444 --> 24:49.362
It seems like the escalators
have been shut down.

24:49.446 --> 24:50.864
Ugh. That way!

24:55.911 --> 24:58.205
Oh, what the fuck? There's no way through.

24:58.288 --> 24:59.289
[Nobu] Shit!

25:00.040 --> 25:01.875
- This one's closed too!
- Let me try!

25:01.958 --> 25:03.627
Son of a bitch!

25:03.710 --> 25:04.628
[Nobu] Damn it!

25:04.711 --> 25:06.588
- [man 6] Where is it?
- [woman 1] I don't see it.

25:06.671 --> 25:07.797
- [man 6] There, anything?
- No.

25:07.881 --> 25:09.549
- [man 6] Check in there!
- This way, come on!

25:09.633 --> 25:12.511
[dramatic music continues]

25:18.683 --> 25:20.060
[panting]

25:20.143 --> 25:21.102
[music stops]

25:21.186 --> 25:22.229
Oh!

25:22.312 --> 25:23.355
Gotcha!

25:23.438 --> 25:25.774
[computer] The can is also a time bomb.

25:25.857 --> 25:27.692
[voice from can]
Safety mechanism deactivated.

25:27.776 --> 25:29.778
- [pinging]
- Gotta go! Right now!

25:29.861 --> 25:35.200
The countdown on the time bomb begins from
the moment someone is holding the can.

25:35.867 --> 25:37.077
Fuck that!

25:37.160 --> 25:38.620
- [zapping]
- [yells]

25:42.290 --> 25:45.544
[computer] The moment you release the can,
the timer resets

25:45.627 --> 25:47.379
and a new countdown begins.

25:47.462 --> 25:48.380
[tense music playing]

25:48.463 --> 25:51.091
- Damn it, I lost five seconds! [gasps]
- [pinging]

25:51.174 --> 25:56.555
Every time the owner of the can changes,
the time limit decreases by five seconds.

25:57.347 --> 25:59.474
Twenty seconds remaining.

26:00.058 --> 26:01.560
- Wait up!
- [both panting]

26:01.643 --> 26:03.937
What? No, no, no, no, no!

26:04.020 --> 26:06.106
The can will be wasted
if nobody takes it, lady!

26:06.189 --> 26:07.482
- But I can't!
- Get moving!

26:07.566 --> 26:09.359
- Reset. Fifty seconds.
- [man 7 yelling]

26:09.442 --> 26:10.819
- [Kazuya] Run!
- [man 7] This way!

26:10.902 --> 26:11.903
- Go on!
- [man 7] Hey, you!

26:11.987 --> 26:13.530
- [man 8] Catch her!
- [man 9] We found it!

26:13.613 --> 26:15.198
- [woman 2] Leave me alone!
- [man 7] Stop!

26:17.200 --> 26:20.579
- [woman 2] Leave me alone!
- [man 7] Where do you think you're going?

26:20.662 --> 26:23.915
- Reset. Fifteen seconds remaining.
- [man 7] Give it to me! Get outta my way!

26:23.999 --> 26:26.042
[players grunting]

26:28.211 --> 26:31.631
- Ten seconds remaining.
- [man 10] Let go! [grunting]

26:31.715 --> 26:33.717
[countdown pinging]

26:38.638 --> 26:39.681
I made it!

26:39.764 --> 26:40.599
[music stops]

26:47.564 --> 26:50.066
First can. Game over.

26:50.650 --> 26:54.863
Since the can has exploded,
no player has cleared the game.

26:56.239 --> 26:57.866
Only nine cans left now.

27:00.869 --> 27:02.787
Second can. Start.

27:02.871 --> 27:04.873
[grunting]

27:09.252 --> 27:10.629
[gasps]

27:10.712 --> 27:12.714
[dynamic music playing]

27:16.885 --> 27:18.178
[bleeping]

27:19.304 --> 27:20.305
[gasps]

27:24.684 --> 27:26.394
[klaxon blaring]

27:27.312 --> 27:28.605
[clanging]

27:29.189 --> 27:30.398
- Look out!
- [gasps]

27:31.566 --> 27:32.859
[shrieks]

27:32.942 --> 27:34.944
[players yelping and screaming]

27:38.073 --> 27:41.451
[Arisu] In this game, we've got no chance
of winning if we go it alone.

27:42.243 --> 27:44.412
- We can relay the can between teammates.
- Natsu!

27:44.496 --> 27:46.956
- Make sure someone makes it back to base.
- [Natsu] Rei!

27:48.208 --> 27:50.085
- [Rei] No chance!
- [man 6] Gimme that can!

27:51.336 --> 27:53.129
- Natsu, take it!
- [man 6] I got her!

27:53.213 --> 27:55.924
- Reset. Fifty seconds remaining.
- [man 6 yells]

27:58.510 --> 28:00.845
- Reset. Forty-five seconds remaining.
- Run, big sis!

28:00.929 --> 28:02.472
- [man 6] Outta my way!
- [Natsu] Run!

28:02.555 --> 28:04.474
- [man 7] Get the hell off of me!
- Got it!

28:05.350 --> 28:07.852
- [Arisu] Nine cans left and eight of us.
- [man 11] Get her!

28:07.936 --> 28:09.562
- [man 12] I see her!
- Got you!

28:09.646 --> 28:11.022
- [Shion gasps]
- [man 11] Hey!

28:11.106 --> 28:12.565
- Got her! Easy…
- [Shion groans]

28:13.233 --> 28:15.318
- [man 11 yells] Bitch!
- [man 12] Let go of it!

28:15.402 --> 28:16.903
- Gimme the damn can!
- [man 11] Give it!

28:16.986 --> 28:18.613
- Shion!
- [man 11] I got it! I got it!

28:18.697 --> 28:20.490
- Arisu!
- Throw it!

28:20.573 --> 28:21.741
- [grunts]
- [yells]

28:26.329 --> 28:27.414
[man 13 grunts]

28:27.497 --> 28:28.331
[yelps]

28:29.666 --> 28:30.917
[all gasp]

28:31.710 --> 28:32.711
[music stops]

28:32.794 --> 28:35.922
- [coughing]
- Second can, game over.

28:36.005 --> 28:41.302
During the game, cans will explode
if they are subject to intense impact.

28:41.386 --> 28:43.304
- Shit!
- [man 12 groans]

28:43.388 --> 28:45.557
Eight cans left.

28:46.683 --> 28:48.727
- [Kazuya yelling]
- [urgent music playing]

28:48.810 --> 28:50.186
[Kazuya] Nobu, get it!

28:50.270 --> 28:52.021
[all grunting]

28:52.105 --> 28:53.690
- [Nobu] Arisu!
- [Arisu] Take it!

28:53.773 --> 28:55.775
- [Nobu grunts]
- Reset.

28:55.859 --> 28:57.318
Fifty seconds remaining.

28:58.236 --> 29:00.905
- [Nobu yells]
- [Tetsu] Leave him alone, assholes!

29:01.656 --> 29:02.991
Arisu!

29:04.909 --> 29:06.745
[man 11] They're getting away!
Catch 'em! Quick!

29:07.704 --> 29:08.872
[Arisu] Kazuya!

29:10.039 --> 29:14.085
It's us or them, that's all!
Either they die, or we die!

29:14.586 --> 29:16.546
- Run! There's no time!
- [man 14] Get him!

29:16.629 --> 29:17.922
[Kazuya] Run!

29:18.006 --> 29:19.924
[Tetsu] He's right! Let's go, come on!

29:20.425 --> 29:22.010
Hurry! Move it!

29:22.510 --> 29:23.887
[man 15 yells] Get out of the way!

29:26.055 --> 29:27.056
[yelling]

29:27.140 --> 29:28.349
[man 16] Gimme the damn can!

29:28.933 --> 29:30.685
[man 17] I gotcha! I gotcha!

29:32.395 --> 29:33.772
- Give it!
- [man 16] Give me the can!

29:34.481 --> 29:35.732
Sachiko! Here!

29:35.815 --> 29:37.609
- Why give it to me?
- [grunts]

29:39.110 --> 29:40.069
- [gasps]
- Reset.

29:40.153 --> 29:42.197
- [Sachiko yelps]
- Twenty seconds remaining.

29:42.280 --> 29:44.324
- [Sachiko screams]
- [man 18] Oh, no you don't!

29:44.407 --> 29:46.159
[man 19] Lady, give it here! Pass!

29:46.701 --> 29:48.453
- [Sachiko shrieks]
- [man 19] What the hell?

29:49.037 --> 29:51.039
- [Sachiko] Oh, let me go!
- [man 20] Stop her!

29:51.122 --> 29:52.916
- Ten seconds remaining.
- [Sachiko] Let me go!

29:52.999 --> 29:54.709
- [Tetsu grunts]
- [Sachiko squeals]

29:54.793 --> 29:57.128
- [man 21] No! It's mine!
- [Tetsu] Go on, Sachiko!

29:57.212 --> 29:59.380
- [countdown pinging]
- [man 21 groaning]

29:59.464 --> 30:00.590
[power whirring]

30:01.466 --> 30:03.468
- [power fades]
- [bell rings]

30:04.886 --> 30:05.845
[Sachiko whimpers]

30:05.929 --> 30:08.348
Third can. Game cleared.

30:08.848 --> 30:10.809
- Congratulations.
- [gasping]

30:13.102 --> 30:14.521
Thank you, Tetsu.

30:14.604 --> 30:15.772
[panting]

30:16.397 --> 30:17.690
Ladies first, right?

30:18.191 --> 30:19.692
- [Sachiko laughs]
- Ow!

30:23.196 --> 30:27.325
Players who clear the game are asked
to please wait in the elevator.

30:27.408 --> 30:29.202
[Kazuya] That's one person saved.

30:29.285 --> 30:30.995
[panting]

30:37.168 --> 30:38.795
[breathing shakily]

30:40.255 --> 30:41.506
[sighs]

30:43.132 --> 30:45.301
[computer] Seven cans left.

30:46.594 --> 30:48.596
- [players grunting]
- [klaxon blaring]

30:49.430 --> 30:51.015
[player screams]

30:51.099 --> 30:52.600
[gasping]

30:53.393 --> 30:54.936
[panting]

30:55.019 --> 30:56.771
[woman yelping]

30:56.855 --> 30:58.439
[man screams]

30:59.607 --> 31:00.900
[Usagi] Himari!

31:00.984 --> 31:02.527
[gasping shakily]

31:02.610 --> 31:03.444
[clanging]

31:03.528 --> 31:05.238
[Himari] Usagi! Help me!

31:05.321 --> 31:07.282
- Ryuji! I'm gonna help her.
- [man screams]

31:07.365 --> 31:09.117
- [Himari yelps]
- [Usagi grunts]

31:09.200 --> 31:10.702
[Himari screams]

31:14.581 --> 31:15.999
[Himari screams]

31:17.166 --> 31:18.751
[Ryuji gasping]

31:21.421 --> 31:22.839
[Sohta exhales]

31:24.340 --> 31:25.758
[grunts]

31:27.051 --> 31:29.053
- [Yuna yelps]
- [Sohta strains]

31:29.137 --> 31:30.388
[groans]

31:33.600 --> 31:35.518
[clangs]

31:37.979 --> 31:38.938
[pinging]

31:39.022 --> 31:40.481
[wind whistling]

31:40.565 --> 31:42.442
- [grunts]
- [Yuna laughs nervously]

31:42.525 --> 31:44.068
[klaxon blares]

31:44.152 --> 31:45.987
- [clanging]
- [gasps and screams]

31:46.070 --> 31:48.072
- [Usagi] Himari!
- [man screams]

31:48.156 --> 31:50.116
[whimpering]

31:50.199 --> 31:52.201
[woman screams]

31:52.911 --> 31:54.245
[Himari whimpering]

31:56.289 --> 31:59.667
You're gonna be okay.
Take my hand. You're gonna be fine.

32:00.793 --> 32:02.420
[Himari whimpers]

32:02.503 --> 32:04.505
[wind gusting strongly]

32:14.474 --> 32:16.100
- [klaxon blares]
- [screams]

32:16.184 --> 32:17.685
- [Usagi] I got you!
- Usagi!

32:17.769 --> 32:18.937
- [clanging]
- [Usagi shrieks]

32:19.020 --> 32:20.438
[Himari screams]

32:21.147 --> 32:22.565
[Usagi] Himari!

32:22.649 --> 32:24.275
- [players screaming]
- [panting]

32:25.860 --> 32:27.487
[straining]

32:32.200 --> 32:33.743
[Usagi gasping]

32:39.123 --> 32:40.750
- [Himari groaning]
- Hang on!

32:44.879 --> 32:46.005
[screams]

32:46.089 --> 32:47.632
[sobbing]

32:53.429 --> 32:54.806
[screams]

32:56.474 --> 32:57.475
[gasps]

33:00.395 --> 33:01.980
[thud]

33:02.981 --> 33:04.315
[sighs]

33:07.151 --> 33:09.153
[wind gusting]

33:13.074 --> 33:15.076
[panting]

33:15.952 --> 33:18.371
- [Natsu] Are you doing okay?
- [Shion] Yeah.

33:19.872 --> 33:21.290
Don't worry about me.

33:22.500 --> 33:24.252
[Natsu] We're gonna make it together.

33:27.171 --> 33:29.757
- [man 15 yells]
- [both grunting]

33:29.841 --> 33:30.842
Leave her alone!

33:32.593 --> 33:33.469
[man 15] Back off!

33:33.553 --> 33:35.304
- [growls]
- [Natsu gasps]

33:35.388 --> 33:36.389
Hey!

33:36.973 --> 33:40.018
Get your hands off her, you piece of shit!

33:40.643 --> 33:41.769
Take the can!

33:41.853 --> 33:42.937
Take it. Run!

33:44.022 --> 33:45.940
- We can clear it together!
- Reset.

33:46.024 --> 33:48.151
- Fifty seconds remaining.
- [man 15] Let go of me, bitch!

33:48.234 --> 33:49.527
Fuck you, asshole!

33:49.610 --> 33:51.612
[urgent music playing]

33:54.782 --> 33:55.867
[man 12 roaring]

33:57.827 --> 33:59.537
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry! Wait!

33:59.620 --> 34:02.165
- [Shion shrieks]
- Wait! I'm sorry! Let go of the can!

34:02.248 --> 34:03.750
- Please!
- [Tetsu] Get off her!

34:03.833 --> 34:06.627
- Leave her alone, you bastard!
- [Shion screaming]

34:06.711 --> 34:08.588
- [man 12] Leave me alone!
- [Tetsu groans]

34:08.671 --> 34:10.381
[panting]

34:12.133 --> 34:13.051
Huh?

34:13.551 --> 34:14.594
- Tetsu!
- What?

34:15.094 --> 34:16.429
- Run!
- Huh?

34:16.512 --> 34:18.181
Just run! Get outta here!

34:18.264 --> 34:21.184
[man 15] That can is mine, asshole!

34:24.437 --> 34:26.147
[all grunting]

34:28.566 --> 34:29.692
Yes!

34:30.777 --> 34:33.946
- No way! Come on! It's a fake! Fuck!
- Huh? Asshole!

34:41.996 --> 34:43.623
So, there you are!

34:44.207 --> 34:45.666
- Get back here!
- [gasps]

34:46.709 --> 34:48.044
[man 6] Hand it over!

34:48.127 --> 34:49.420
- [grunting]
- [Shion gasping]

34:49.504 --> 34:51.339
[man 6] Let go! Give it to me!

34:51.422 --> 34:53.549
[both grunting]

34:54.509 --> 34:56.010
[Shion yells]

34:56.094 --> 34:57.345
[music stops]

35:04.310 --> 35:05.603
Shion!

35:05.686 --> 35:08.189
[sobbing] No!

35:08.272 --> 35:09.273
[running footsteps]

35:14.946 --> 35:16.364
[gasps]

35:19.117 --> 35:20.535
[breathing shakily]

35:25.623 --> 35:26.707
Big sis?

35:27.917 --> 35:30.086
[gasps] What have you done?

35:32.004 --> 35:33.840
[melancholy music plays]

35:33.923 --> 35:34.882
[sobs]

35:35.925 --> 35:36.968
No…

35:38.678 --> 35:40.680
[sobbing]

35:47.520 --> 35:48.896
[Tetsu] What is this shit?

35:50.648 --> 35:52.525
[yells] What the fuck is going on?

35:53.818 --> 35:55.361
Tetsu, calm down.

35:55.444 --> 35:58.489
I am calm. I'm fine. I'm perfectly calm.

35:59.490 --> 36:01.492
- You have to stay positive.
- Shut up!

36:05.288 --> 36:06.622
[Kazuya] Let's get to it.

36:17.049 --> 36:18.801
[woman breathing unsteadily]

36:32.148 --> 36:33.608
[sighs]

36:46.245 --> 36:48.247
[melancholy music continues]

36:48.331 --> 36:50.374
[wind whistling]

37:05.389 --> 37:07.058
[both grunting]

37:07.975 --> 37:09.602
[wind gusts]

37:10.519 --> 37:12.230
[both gasping]

37:17.026 --> 37:18.194
[clangs]

37:18.277 --> 37:20.029
- [bleep]
- [Usagi] Yes!

37:20.112 --> 37:21.656
- [klaxon blares]
- [gasps]

37:21.739 --> 37:23.574
[missiles clanging]

37:24.450 --> 37:26.035
[wails]

37:26.619 --> 37:28.287
[screams]

37:30.498 --> 37:32.500
- [players yelling]
- [Yuna whimpering]

37:34.210 --> 37:36.837
Yuna! Stop looking down.

37:37.505 --> 37:38.589
Eyes on me.

37:38.673 --> 37:39.966
[whimpering]

37:40.049 --> 37:42.301
I can't go on anymore! I can't!

37:43.678 --> 37:45.263
- [sobbing]
- Keep going.

37:45.763 --> 37:47.974
If we don't keep going,
the balls will target us.

37:48.057 --> 37:50.893
And if we don't press the buzzers,
we can't clear the game.

37:51.394 --> 37:54.272
Yuna… grab on to the rope, okay?

37:54.897 --> 37:56.607
I've got you. You're gonna be okay.

37:56.691 --> 37:58.150
- Grab it.
- [sobbing]

37:59.652 --> 38:02.613
That's it!
You're doing great! Don't look down!

38:02.697 --> 38:03.739
[klaxon blares]

38:05.074 --> 38:06.492
[gasping]

38:08.369 --> 38:09.412
[gasps]

38:09.495 --> 38:11.080
- [missiles clanging]
- [grunts]

38:14.041 --> 38:15.710
[groans]

38:15.793 --> 38:16.919
[straining]

38:17.003 --> 38:18.087
[man screams]

38:19.505 --> 38:21.007
- [music fades]
- [gasps]

38:21.799 --> 38:23.009
[Ryuji groans]

38:24.218 --> 38:25.845
[Usagi gasps]

38:25.928 --> 38:27.054
- [Ryuji grunts]
- [Usagi gasps]

38:27.138 --> 38:29.015
[wind whistling]

38:29.515 --> 38:31.058
[Ryuji straining]

38:31.142 --> 38:32.143
[Usagi gasping]

38:35.521 --> 38:37.356
- Are you okay?
- Yeah!

38:38.190 --> 38:39.442
[groans]

38:40.484 --> 38:42.028
[both panting]

38:44.447 --> 38:47.033
Forget about me. Just keep going.

38:47.783 --> 38:50.619
I got this. I'm gonna clear the game.

38:51.537 --> 38:53.039
[grunts]

38:56.625 --> 38:58.586
Fifth can. Start.

38:58.669 --> 38:59.879
Come and try!

39:00.379 --> 39:02.506
[yells] Arisu!

39:02.590 --> 39:04.300
[man 22] You bastard! Give it to me!

39:04.884 --> 39:06.260
[man 23] Don't let him escape!

39:06.344 --> 39:07.845
[Arisu panting]

39:10.264 --> 39:11.474
- [grunts]
- [wails]

39:11.557 --> 39:13.267
[both growling]

39:15.770 --> 39:17.313
Rei, take it! Run!

39:17.855 --> 39:19.815
[man 23] Little girl! Come here!

39:21.317 --> 39:22.276
[yelling]

39:22.360 --> 39:24.987
- [Tetsu] Stay where you are!
- [Arisu] Rei! Go!

39:26.197 --> 39:27.740
[players yelling]

39:28.824 --> 39:29.784
[chiming]

39:29.867 --> 39:32.328
[computer] Fifth can. Game cleared.

39:33.412 --> 39:34.747
Thank you.

39:39.168 --> 39:41.212
Sixth can. Start.

39:46.008 --> 39:47.968
- [Arisu] Nobu, Nobu!
- [Nobu yells]

39:49.720 --> 39:51.097
- Natsu!
- [Natsu gasps]

39:53.265 --> 39:54.266
Tetsu!

39:56.685 --> 39:58.145
[roars]

39:59.605 --> 40:00.689
[chiming]

40:07.488 --> 40:08.989
[Natsu] Nobu, over here!

40:10.491 --> 40:11.951
Ten seconds remaining.

40:12.034 --> 40:13.661
[man 15] Give me the can!

40:13.744 --> 40:15.663
- Give it to me!
- [Arisu] Run! Go!

40:15.746 --> 40:17.665
- [countdown pinging]
- Okay!

40:20.084 --> 40:23.212
- [chimes]
- Seventh can. Game cleared.

40:23.295 --> 40:24.463
[groans]

40:24.547 --> 40:25.673
I'm sorry…

40:27.133 --> 40:28.092
I'm sorry!

40:30.261 --> 40:31.929
[chiming]

40:32.012 --> 40:33.597
Three cans left.

40:33.681 --> 40:35.391
And there's three of us left.

40:36.058 --> 40:37.101
Yeah.

40:38.727 --> 40:42.606
I'm gonna win this time.
I'll win for big sis.

40:43.691 --> 40:44.733
[dynamic music playing]

40:46.277 --> 40:48.737
- [can buzzes]
- [computer] Thirty seconds remaining.

41:00.833 --> 41:03.002
- [can buzzes]
- Twenty seconds remaining.

41:07.465 --> 41:09.049
[Natsu groans]

41:12.428 --> 41:13.637
[can buzzes]

41:13.721 --> 41:16.891
Reset. Thirty-five seconds remaining.

41:22.271 --> 41:25.524
Reset. Thirty seconds remaining.

41:26.609 --> 41:27.651
[Natsu yelps]

41:29.153 --> 41:31.322
[woman 2] I'm gonna kill you!

41:33.240 --> 41:34.450
[Natsu gasping]

41:35.367 --> 41:36.785
[woman 2 yells]

41:36.869 --> 41:38.954
[yells] It's mine!

41:40.289 --> 41:42.917
Reset. Twenty-five seconds remaining.

41:44.793 --> 41:47.922
Reset. Twenty seconds remaining.

41:56.597 --> 41:58.933
- Reset. Fifteen seconds remaining.
- [can buzzes]

41:59.016 --> 42:00.434
[Natsu] Get the fuck off me!

42:01.977 --> 42:02.978
[screams]

42:05.856 --> 42:08.025
- Reset.
- [countdown pinging]

42:08.108 --> 42:09.944
Ten seconds remaining.

42:10.486 --> 42:12.279
[man 15] Gotcha! That can's mine!

42:12.780 --> 42:15.366
Give it to me! Let go of my can!

42:15.449 --> 42:17.535
- Let go!
- [Natsu] Hands off!

42:18.452 --> 42:19.662
[woman 2] It's mine!

42:19.745 --> 42:21.789
[Natsu yells]

42:23.541 --> 42:25.793
No!

42:28.837 --> 42:31.882
- [Arisu gasps]
- Eighth can. Game over.

42:31.966 --> 42:35.386
It can't be… Natsu…

42:35.928 --> 42:37.346
[gasps]

42:37.429 --> 42:39.682
It can't be. [sobs]

42:40.307 --> 42:42.601
[whimpers] I can't take this!

42:45.187 --> 42:46.397
[crying]

42:46.480 --> 42:48.357
They're the last two left…

42:53.153 --> 42:55.155
- [clanging]
- [players screaming]

42:58.158 --> 42:59.493
[moaning]

43:01.912 --> 43:03.497
[grunting]

43:04.081 --> 43:06.000
[rumbling]

43:06.083 --> 43:07.334
[groans]

43:07.418 --> 43:09.211
- [clangs]
- [wheezing]

43:09.795 --> 43:11.046
[bleeps]

43:12.089 --> 43:14.091
- [wind gusting]
- [rumbling continues]

43:16.594 --> 43:17.595
- [clang]
- [gasps]

43:17.678 --> 43:19.054
[bleeps]

43:21.098 --> 43:23.100
[heavy rumbling and rattling]

43:25.811 --> 43:27.229
[shivering]

43:31.358 --> 43:32.943
[heavy creaking]

43:33.027 --> 43:34.945
[panting]

43:38.657 --> 43:40.659
- [computer] One more to go.
- [Taro] One more!

43:40.743 --> 43:41.869
[klaxon blares]

43:41.952 --> 43:42.911
[yelps]

43:45.748 --> 43:47.291
[whimpering]

43:48.876 --> 43:51.879
Help me! Help me! I don't wanna die!

43:51.962 --> 43:53.130
[wails]

43:53.213 --> 43:54.465
- [panting]
- Watch out!

43:54.548 --> 43:55.424
[screams]

43:56.133 --> 43:57.509
Taro!

44:01.555 --> 44:03.599
[gasping]

44:08.979 --> 44:10.648
[poignant music playing]

44:10.731 --> 44:12.232
[panting and sobbing]

44:17.488 --> 44:19.198
[Kazuya] Hey! Gimme that!

44:19.281 --> 44:21.075
[groaning]

44:21.158 --> 44:22.743
[screams]

44:23.744 --> 44:24.787
[Kazuya] Punk!

44:25.621 --> 44:26.747
[Arisu groans]

44:27.539 --> 44:28.457
Hey!

44:28.540 --> 44:31.794
- Twenty seconds remaining.
- [Kazuya] Go first! Take it!

44:31.877 --> 44:33.545
Arisu, leave now! Get outta here!

44:33.629 --> 44:36.924
- [man 24 wails] You broke my arm!
- I said go!

44:37.424 --> 44:39.218
- [man 12 groaning]
- [gasping]

44:40.260 --> 44:41.845
[men moaning]

44:42.513 --> 44:45.307
- [woman 3] Stop him!
- [man 25] Catch him!

44:45.391 --> 44:47.601
[gasping and sobbing]

44:52.022 --> 44:53.816
[man 23] Let me go, you bastard!

44:55.901 --> 44:56.944
[can buzzes]

44:57.027 --> 44:58.654
- Ten seconds remaining.
- Go!

44:58.737 --> 45:00.989
There's no time! Run!

45:02.533 --> 45:04.827
- [countdown pinging]
- [teammates yelling encouragement]

45:04.910 --> 45:06.912
[Tetsu] You can do it!

45:06.995 --> 45:07.913
[Sachiko] Go!

45:08.914 --> 45:09.832
[groaning]

45:09.915 --> 45:11.375
[can whirring]

45:11.458 --> 45:13.001
[gasping]

45:14.586 --> 45:16.296
Ninth can. Game cleared.

45:16.380 --> 45:18.382
[all panting]

45:21.343 --> 45:22.928
[Kazuya] We're even now, kid.

45:26.390 --> 45:27.766
Don't worry about me.

45:28.684 --> 45:30.436
There's one more can left.

45:31.645 --> 45:33.021
I'll see you later.

45:33.522 --> 45:35.691
[gasps] Kazuya…

45:37.526 --> 45:39.528
[poignant music continues]

45:40.070 --> 45:41.238
[wind whistling]

45:41.321 --> 45:43.323
[breathing heavily]

45:44.825 --> 45:46.118
[gasping]

46:13.687 --> 46:15.105
[wind gusting]

46:43.342 --> 46:45.344
[poignant music continues]

47:07.658 --> 47:09.660
[all panting]

47:12.788 --> 47:14.706
[can] Safety mechanism deactivated.

47:14.790 --> 47:16.250
[all yelling]

47:18.001 --> 47:19.169
[Kazuya] It's mine!

47:20.295 --> 47:22.089
[man 26] No! Damn you!

47:30.180 --> 47:31.932
- Kazuya!
- Kazuya!

47:33.016 --> 47:35.060
- [Sachiko] Run!
- [Nobu] Come on, you can do it!

47:35.143 --> 47:36.979
- Run! You can make it!
- [Sachiko] Go, Kazuya!

47:37.062 --> 47:38.105
[Nobu] Go, Kazuya!

47:38.188 --> 47:39.064
[man 9 roars]

47:39.147 --> 47:40.607
- [Nobu] What?
- [Sachiko] Kazuya!

47:40.691 --> 47:42.025
[groaning]

47:42.109 --> 47:43.277
Give it!

48:02.337 --> 48:03.755
[roars]

48:03.839 --> 48:04.965
- No!
- [Tetsu] Shit!

48:05.048 --> 48:06.842
- [all yelling]
- [Tetsu] Open the door!

48:06.925 --> 48:09.303
- Stop it!
- Kazuya!

48:09.386 --> 48:10.721
[roaring]

48:12.014 --> 48:13.682
- [man 12] It's mine!
- [Kazuya wails]

48:17.227 --> 48:19.271
I got it! I got it!

48:21.648 --> 48:24.234
- [man 9] You're going nowhere!
- [yells]

48:24.318 --> 48:25.819
[players moaning]

48:26.737 --> 48:28.280
[all gasping]

48:28.363 --> 48:30.365
[music swells]

48:36.246 --> 48:37.623
Fuck it!

48:49.843 --> 48:51.595
Come on!

48:52.429 --> 48:54.389
- [man 12] Let go of it, asshole!
- [man 11 roars]

48:55.724 --> 48:57.392
[Kazuya growls]

48:58.644 --> 49:00.020
Where you going?

49:02.773 --> 49:04.691
[panting]

49:04.775 --> 49:06.234
[man 9 roars]

49:09.905 --> 49:10.948
[screams]

49:20.582 --> 49:21.917
[man 9 screams]

49:23.502 --> 49:24.711
[can buzzes]

49:24.795 --> 49:26.630
Ten seconds remaining.

49:29.424 --> 49:30.467
[roars]

49:31.927 --> 49:33.095
- [music stops]
- [can whirring]

49:34.972 --> 49:36.098
[chuckles]

49:38.433 --> 49:40.686
Kazuya!

49:42.062 --> 49:44.064
[inspiring music playing]

49:49.277 --> 49:50.362
[gasping]

49:58.412 --> 49:59.621
[panting]

50:07.295 --> 50:09.297
[wind howling]

50:14.219 --> 50:15.679
[strains]

50:15.762 --> 50:17.055
[gasps]

50:17.681 --> 50:18.974
[gasping]

50:19.933 --> 50:21.268
[bleeping]

50:21.351 --> 50:22.769
- [computer] Bingo.
- [gasps]

50:24.938 --> 50:26.690
[music swells]

50:26.773 --> 50:29.860
CONGRATULATIONS

50:56.136 --> 50:57.804
[music fades]

50:57.888 --> 50:59.890
[wind gusting]

51:02.559 --> 51:05.187
[Banda] Are you starting
to enjoy this place now?

51:06.396 --> 51:09.191
[Ryuji] I did what I promised.
I brought Usagi this far.

51:09.274 --> 51:11.234
[Banda] The next game
will be the last one.

51:11.735 --> 51:14.905
I'll need your help to ensure
Arisu stays here forever.

51:16.281 --> 51:18.158
All this trouble for just one man?

51:19.367 --> 51:23.080
This one man led us to clear
all the stages in the previous games.

51:23.163 --> 51:26.374
And it's thanks to him
that I've become a citizen of this world.

51:27.417 --> 51:29.878
Arisu will be perfect in this place.

51:31.963 --> 51:35.133
Who are you? What do you want?

51:40.138 --> 51:41.556
Are you the Joker?

51:42.099 --> 51:45.435
- [laughing]
- [foreboding music playing]

51:46.895 --> 51:49.815
I've experienced your world.
I've memorized everything.

51:50.357 --> 51:52.943
If there's a person or an entity
that governs the land of the dead,

51:53.026 --> 51:54.152
then I wanna know about it.

51:55.237 --> 51:56.863
You're being too greedy.

51:57.531 --> 52:00.534
You should concentrate
on what I've asked you to do.

52:00.617 --> 52:02.494
Your job's not done yet.

52:08.667 --> 52:11.378
In the final game, I want you to kill her.

52:12.420 --> 52:15.006
Then, your work here will be done.

52:18.802 --> 52:21.555
If you kill that woman,
no reason to return,

52:21.638 --> 52:23.557
and he'll remain in this world.

52:25.600 --> 52:27.519
And if I do what you ask of me?

52:33.108 --> 52:37.445
If you kill Usagi,
I promise to grant your wish.

52:45.287 --> 52:48.290
I promise you will learn
about who governs the afterlife.

52:49.082 --> 52:51.751
I promise you will learn
about the land of the dead.

52:52.377 --> 52:55.046
A world beyond your wildest dreams.

52:55.755 --> 52:57.799
After that, you can do as you please.

52:58.383 --> 53:02.971
You can become a citizen of this world,
or you can return to your own world.

53:06.558 --> 53:09.394
To be honest,
I think you got a pretty good deal.

53:22.449 --> 53:24.618
[Yaba] You know,
you really shouldn't use this place

53:24.701 --> 53:26.870
as your own personal playground.

53:26.953 --> 53:31.082
I was happy to become a citizen here.
But all the good players are gone.

53:31.583 --> 53:35.712
I have learned that the only way to enjoy
this world is to have the best players.

53:36.504 --> 53:37.839
I have to agree.

53:38.340 --> 53:41.885
It so happens that, on my side,
there are no good players either.

53:42.385 --> 53:45.013
We're going to need
good players in this world.

53:46.431 --> 53:50.644
I hear you, but… let's be honest,
you're still enjoying yourself.

53:52.520 --> 53:54.314
Hm. Maybe.

53:54.814 --> 53:55.815
[chuckles]

54:11.039 --> 54:12.916
[wind whistling]

54:14.751 --> 54:16.503
[Rei] So this is it? The final game.

54:16.586 --> 54:17.587
"GAME" ARENA THIS WAY

54:17.671 --> 54:19.673
[dramatic music playing]

54:21.299 --> 54:23.885
So, Shibuya is the final game arena.

54:24.719 --> 54:27.430
Let's hope that we can make it out alive.

54:28.098 --> 54:31.101
If I don't make it,
I hope you'll remember me now and then.

54:33.311 --> 54:34.771
I wouldn't count on it.

54:35.647 --> 54:36.856
Jeez, man.

54:37.649 --> 54:39.484
You better not forget about me either.

54:40.902 --> 54:43.029
You're someone no one could ever forget.

54:43.947 --> 54:44.864
[Tetsu scoffs]

54:45.490 --> 54:49.619
If, in the end, the only way out is
betrayal, no hard feelings, okay?

54:50.704 --> 54:52.205
That's life, I guess.

54:56.126 --> 54:57.168
[Arisu] Ready?

55:00.880 --> 55:02.090
Let's do this.

55:23.403 --> 55:25.947
[Tetsu] I've got a really bad
feeling about this one.

55:26.531 --> 55:27.991
[Rei] Who goes first?

55:39.586 --> 55:41.129
Ladies first, madam.

55:41.212 --> 55:42.756
Age before beauty.

55:46.426 --> 55:48.261
[music intensifying]

56:08.365 --> 56:09.949
[music fades]

56:10.033 --> 56:12.035
[buzz of voices]

56:12.118 --> 56:13.578
[horns honking]

56:14.913 --> 56:16.915
[excited chatter and laughter]

56:21.669 --> 56:23.671
[tense music playing]

56:43.316 --> 56:44.275
Huh?

56:47.153 --> 56:48.571
[music stops]

56:50.240 --> 56:52.242
[theme music playing]
